Timestamp: 2026-06-15T15:00:00+05:30
Status: Force rebuild — comprehensive monthly report + XLSX download

Changes:
  - The monthly summary at /ops-os/report-monthly was missing faculty
    attendance, success coach activity, and fee collection data from
    the rollup. The previous aggregator (getWeeklyRollup, aliased as
    getPeriodRollup) only summed metrics inside
    ops_os.submission_value. Faculty attendance lives in
    public.instructor_attendance, coach calls in
    public.success_coach_daily_log, and fee data in
    public.fee_collection_snapshot — none of those were ever joined
    into the monthly view.
  - New aggregator: packages/shared/src/ops_os/monthly_full.ts
    exports getMonthlyFullRollup(campus_id, period_start, period_end)
    which queries all four sources in parallel and returns a single
    MonthlyFullRollup with ops + faculty + coach + fees.
  - Monthly page (+page.server.ts + +page.svelte) now uses the new
    aggregator. UI shows:
      • Day completeness (Ops OS submissions)
      • Academic + daily attendance (BOA submissions)
      • Faculty attendance (full month, from instructor_attendance) ★ NEW
      • Success coach calls (full month, from coach daily log) ★ NEW
      • Fee collection end-of-month snapshot ★ NEW
      • Student ops + incidents
    Also a clear warning banner when BOAs missed >50% of days, so
    operators know which figures cover the full month vs. only
    submitted days.
  - New XLSX endpoint: GET /api/ops-os/monthly-report.xlsx
      ?month=YYYY-MM-01     (default: last completed month)
      ?campus=<uuid>        (one campus)
      ?university=<uuid>    (university-wide download — admin/COS only)
    Produces multi-sheet workbook: Summary + per-campus Ops, Faculty,
    Coaches, Fees sheets. NIAT-styled with maroon headers, frozen
    panes, alternating stripes.
  - University-wide download UI: a new amber panel on the monthly page
    lets ADMIN/PROGRAM_OPS/COS pick any university and download a
    single XLSX containing every campus in that university for the
    chosen month — Ops + Faculty + Coaches + Fees consolidated.
  - Authorization: existing /ops-os/report-monthly role guard
    preserved; the XLSX endpoint re-checks the same role list and
    additionally guards ?university=<uuid> behind ADMIN/PROGRAM_OPS/COS.
  - No data layer migrations — all reads against existing tables.
